  fileNameEn: README.txt
  fileNamePt: LEIA-ME.txt
  titleEn: Terminal 07
  titlePt: Terminal 07
  bodyEn: 'OPERATIONS TERMINAL 07 - INSTRUCTIONS


    1. This terminal is wired
    into every camera of the building.

    2. The person on the ground hears your
    voice. Speak clearly.

    3. Cameras: open LIFELINE.EXE.

    4. The door of
    this room opens with a code. You will get the code when it is necessary.

    5.
    Do not shut the terminal down while she is exposed.


    - Inside contact'
  bodyPt: "TERMINAL DE OPERA\xC7\xD5ES 07 - INSTRU\xC7\xD5ES\n\n1. Este terminal
    est\xE1 ligado a todas as c\xE2meras do pr\xE9dio.\n2. A pessoa em campo ouve
    a sua voz. Fale com clareza.\n3. C\xE2meras: abra o LIFELINE.EXE.\n4. A porta
    desta sala abre com um c\xF3digo. Voc\xEA vai receber o c\xF3digo quando for
    necess\xE1rio.\n5. N\xE3o desligue o terminal com ela exposta.\n\n- Contato interno"
